sequenceDiagram
    participant Job as "allocationJob: Control"
    participant Run as "allocationRunService: Service"
    participant Planner as "allocationEngine: Service"
    participant ETA as "deliveryEtaService: Service"
    participant Map as "googleMapsCache: Entity"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    Job->>Run: StartAsync(published allocation_run cutoff)
    Run->>+DB: Acquire distributed/idempotency lock
    Run->>+DB: Snapshot approved eligible orders and shared stock pool
    Run->>+ETA: Resolve schedule, distance and ETA inputs
    ETA->>+Map: Read cached warehouse-retailer distance
    Map-->>-ETA: Versioned distance or controlled provider error
    ETA-->>-Run: ETA/schedule/transit snapshot
    Run->>Planner: Plan orders by server_received_at then order code
    loop Each order line
        Planner->>Planner: Filter SKU, active/non-expired batch, Available, distance, ETA and MLOR
        Planner->>Planner: Greedy weighted score, tie-break batch id, recalc quantity score
        Planner->>Planner: Select batch fragments, then resolve HSD discount SKU→Category
    end
    alt Every line complete
        Planner->>DB: Persist tentative allocation, prices, candidates and trace
        DB-->>-Run: AwaitingRunApproval proposal
    else Any line short
        Planner->>Planner: Roll back all tentative quantity for this order
        Planner->>DB: Persist ShortInRun result and trace
    end
    Note over Planner,DB: Tentative plan changes neither OnHand nor Reserved no cross order batch reassignment




